@PromotionService_HostAddress = http://localhost:6207
@internalKey = deliveryapp-development-internal-key-change-before-production
@customerId = 8f14e45f-ea1c-4f2e-9b3d-77c0d5a1b201
@orderId = b1d9a6c4-3e57-4f80-9a2c-1e6f4b8d0c33

### Kiểm tra FREESHIP
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/validate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "code": "FREESHIP",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "orderAmount": 65400
}

### Giữ mã cho đơn hàng (idempotent theo orderId)
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/reserve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "code": "FREESHIP",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "orderAmount": 65400
}

### Thay ID bằng reservationId nhận từ request reserve
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/commit
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Health
GET {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/health/ready
